---
const title='HARF-WAY ADS｜広告主ポータル UI Preview';
---
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>{title}</title>
<style is:global>
:root{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;background:#f2eee4;color:#171715}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f2eee4}.page{max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding:22px 16px 50px}.notice{margin-bottom:12px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #d8cebf;border-radius:12px;background:#fffaf2;color:#766b5b;font-size:11px}.notice b{color:#171715}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.panel{min-width:0;padding:24px;border:1px solid #d8cebf;border-radius:24px;background:#fffdf8}.eyebrow{margin:0 0 10px;color:#7d684d;font:800 10px/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.17em}.panel h1,.panel h2{margin:0;letter-spacing:-.04em}.panel h1{font-size:25px}.panel h2{font-size:24px}.lead{margin:15px 0 24px;color:#9c8c75;font-size:13px}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:13px 12px}.field{display:grid;gap:6px}.field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.field label{font-size:11px;font-weight:850}.field input,.field textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #d8cebf;border-radius:11px;background:#fff;color:#6c604f}.field textarea{height:92px}.upload{padding:18px 12px;border:1px dashed #b9ab95;border-radius:13px;background:#fff;font-size:11px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.chip{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #d7cdbd;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;font-size:9px}.preview-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}.old-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px;width:360px;max-width:100%}.old-tabs button{min-height:68px;border:1px solid #d7cdbd;border-radius:11px;background:#fffdf8;color:#76664f;font-size:9px;font-weight:850}.old-tabs button.active{background:#171715;color:#fff;border-color:#171715}.preview-zone{display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:20px 0 8px;min-height:520px}.preview-card{position:relative;width:320px;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:9/16;border:8px solid #171715;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;background:#d6ccb8}.art{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(155deg,rgba(255,255,255,.4),transparent 35%),repeating-linear-gradient(12deg,rgba(32,25,15,.12) 0 1px,transparent 1px 18px),linear-gradient(180deg,#efe7d5,#afa48f)}.art:before,.art:after{content:'';position:absolute;border:1px solid rgba(40,32,20,.35);background:rgba(255,250,238,.18)}.art:before{left:10%;top:17%;width:58%;height:26%;transform:skewY(-8deg)}.art:after{right:8%;bottom:18%;width:50%;height:34%;transform:skewY(8deg)}.preview-mid{position:absolute;z-index:2;top:49%;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;color:#fff;font-weight:900}.copy{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:18px;right:18px;bottom:28px;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 7px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}.copy small{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;font:800 8px/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em}.copy b{display:block;font-size:20px}.copy span{display:block;margin-top:13px;font-size:14px;font-weight:850}#hwads-open-standalone-preview{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:18px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #ded8cc}#hwads-open-standalone-preview button{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #171715;border-radius:10px;background:#171715;color:#fff;font-weight:900}#hwads-open-standalone-preview button b{color:#d8ff59}#hwads-open-standalone-preview small{color:#8a857b;font-size:9px;line-height:1.5}
@media(max-width:1000px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.preview-head{display:block}.old-tabs{margin-top:16px;width:100%}}@media(max-width:650px){.page{padding:8px}.panel{padding:16px;border-radius:18px}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.full{grid-column:auto}.old-tabs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.preview-card{width:290px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="page">
<div class="notice"><b>ログイン不要のUI確認用Previewです。</b> 認証・広告申込・DB・R2・計測には接続していません。右側のPC / スマホ切替には、広告主ポータルへ入れる実装と同じJSを使っています。</div>
<div class="grid">
<section class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">NEW CAMPAIGN</p><h1>広告を申し込む</h1><p class="lead">保存すると「審査待ち」になります。HARF-WAYが承認するまで配信は始まりません。</p><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label>作品名</label><input value="作品タイトル"></div><div class="field"><label>キャッチ</label><input value="一番伝えたい一言"></div><div class="field full"><label>紹介文</label><textarea>ゲームの特徴や、読者に伝えたいこと</textarea></div><div class="field"><label>ストアURL</label><input value="https://..."></div><div class="field"><label>配信終了日</label><input value="年 / 月 / 日"></div><div class="field full"><label>広告素材</label><div class="upload">画像 / 短尺動画を選ぶ<br><small>JPG / PNG / WebP：3MBまで ／ MP4 / WebM：10MBまで</small></div></div><div class="field full"><label>タグ</label><div class="chips"><span class="chip">ローグライク</span><span class="chip">デッキ構築</span><span class="chip">クリーチャー</span><span class="chip">短編ADV</span><span class="chip">ホラー</span><span class="chip">アクション</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="panel preview-panel"><div class="preview-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">LIVE PREVIEW</p><h2>掲載されたときの見え方</h2></div><div class="old-tabs"><button type="button" data-fixture="playlist">プレイリスト</button><button type="button" data-fixture="scraps">切れ端</button><button type="button" data-fixture="playback" class="active">WAYS</button><button type="button" data-fixture="sale">SALE WATCH</button></div></div><div class="preview-zone"><article class="preview-card"><div class="art"></div><div class="preview-mid">作品...</div><div class="copy"><small>PR · SPONSORED</small><b id="fixtureTitle">作品タイトル</b><span id="fixtureCatch">キャッチコピー</span></div></article></div><div id="hwads-open-standalone-preview"><button type="button"><span>実画面で掲載位置を確認</span><b>↗</b></button><small>現在の入力内容と選択した画像 / 動画を、実際の公開画面へ反映して確認できます。PC / スマホ対応。</small></div></section>
</div>
</main>
<script is:inline>(()=>{const tabs=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-fixture]')];const labels={playlist:['PLAYLIST','プレイリスト掲載'],scraps:['切れ端','切れ端掲載'],playback:['作品タイトル','キャッチコピー'],sale:['SALE WATCH','セール掲載']};tabs.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{tabs.forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===b));const t=labels[b.dataset.fixture]||labels.playback;document.getElementById('fixtureTitle').textContent=t[0];document.getElementById('fixtureCatch').textContent=t[1]}));document.querySelector('#hwads-open-standalone-preview button')?.addEventListener('click',()=>alert('UI確認用Previewのため、実画面遷移は無効です。'))})();</script>
<script is:inline src="/ads-portal-preview-layout-v3.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
